:"formatsettingsinformation";s:97:"<br />To reset the settings of the course format to the defaults, click on the icon to the right.";s:9:"setlayout";s:10:"Set layout";s:17:"setlayout_default";s:7:"Default";s:29:"setlayout_no_toggle_section_x";s:19:"No toggle section x";s:23:"setlayout_no_section_no";s:17:"No section number";s:40:"setlayout_no_toggle_section_x_section_no";s:38:"No toggle section x and section number";s:24:"setlayout_no_toggle_word";s:14:"No toggle word";s:41:"setlayout_no_toggle_word_toggle_section_x";s:35:"No toggle word and toggle section x";s:52:"setlayout_no_toggle_word_toggle_section_x_section_no";s:51:"No toggle word, toggle section x and section number";s:13:"setlayout_all";s:76:"Alternar a palavra e o número da seção, 'Tópico x' / 'Semana x'/ 'Dia x'";s:36:"setlayout_toggle_word_section_number";s:41:"Alternar a palavra e o número da seção";s:31:"setlayout_toggle_word_section_x";s:55:"Alternar a palavra e 'Tópico x' / 'Semana x' / 'Dia x'";s:21:"setlayout_toggle_word";s:18:"Alternar a palavra";s:41:"setlayout_toggle_section_x_section_number";s:55:"'Tópico x' / 'Semana x' / 'Dia x' e número da seção";s:24:"setlayout_section_number";s:18:"Número da seção";s:22:"setlayout_no_additions";s:13:"Sem adicionar";s:26:"setlayout_toggle_section_x";s:34:"'Tópico x' / 'Semana x' / 'Dia x'";s:17:"setlayoutelements";s:17:"Definir elementos";s:18:"setlayoutstructure";s:9:"Estrutura";s:23:"setlayoutstructuretopic";s:7:"Tópico";s:22:"setlayoutstructureweek";s:6:"Semana";s:30:"setlayoutstructurelatweekfirst";s:21:"Semana atual primeiro";s:35:"setlayoutstructurecurrenttopicfirst";s:22:"Tópico atual primeiro";s:21:"setlayoutstructureday";s:3:"Dia";s:11:"resetlayout";s:16:"Redefinir Layout";s:14:"resetalllayout";s:7:"Layouts";s:21:"layoutstructuretopics";s:6:"topics";s:20:"layoutstructureweeks";s:5:"weeks";s:19:"layoutstructuredays";s:4:"days";s:23:"enableadditionalmoddata";s:29:"Enable additional information";s:27:"enableadditionalmoddatadesc";s:367:"This is a 'Site level' switch to turn the activity information on or off.  It needs to be 'on' for the related settings that operate at a course level to take effect.  As this functionality can be computationally expensive, then it is strongly suggested that you undertake full testing before using on a production system.  Note: Purges the cache caches when changed.";s:21:"showadditionalmoddata";s:52:"Mostrar informações adicionais para: {$a} no curso";s:26:"showadditionalmoddata_help";s:165:"Permite que todos os usuários vejam o prazo da atividade e os usuários com permissão de avaliação vejam o número de envios na página do curso para atividades.";s:28:"defaultshowadditionalmoddata";s:44:"Default course 'Show additional information'";s:32:"defaultshowadditionalmoddatadesc";s:156:"If an activity is set at site level (below) to show additional information then this setting states the default state of the course specific instance of it.";s:17:"resetactivitymeta";s:29:"Additional module information";s:20:"resetallactivitymeta";s:33:"All additional module information";s:22:"resetactivitymeta_help";s:74:"Resets the additional module information to follow the site default value.";s:25:"resetallactivitymeta_help";s:78:"Resets all the additional module information to follow the site default value.";s:34:"courseadditionalmoddatamaxstudents";s:95:"Set the maximum number of students on a course that 'Show additional information' will apply to";s:38:"courseadditionalmoddatamaxstudentsdesc";s:392:"Additional information can take time to calculate, especially on large courses, so here you can set the maximum number of students that a couse can have for the functionality to show on that course.  Above that value, the 'Additional information' will NOT be calculated or show regardless of the course settings!  A value of '0' means 'unlimited'.  Note: Purges the cache caches when changed.";s:35:"courseadditionalmoddatastudentsinfo";s:36:"Status das informações adicionais:";s:44:"courseadditionalmoddatastudentsinfounlimited";s:94:"Informações adicionais serão mostradas para as atividades habilitadas para {$a} estudantes.";s:46:"courseadditionalmoddatastudentsinfolimitedshow";s:292:"Informações adicionais serão mostradas para as atividades habilitadas para {$a->students} estudantes dado que o número não excede o máximo de '{$a->maxstudents}' definido pelo administrador na configuração 'courseadditionalmoddatamaxstudents' do formato de curso Tópicos Contraídos.";s:48:"courseadditionalmoddatastudentsinfolimitednoshow";s:289:"Informações adicionais NÃO serão exibidas para as atividades habilitadas para {$a->students} estudantes, pois o número excede o máximo de '{$a->maxstudents}' definido pelo administrador na configuração  'courseadditionalmoddatamaxstudents' do formato de curso Tópicos Contraídos.";s:39:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformation";s:31:"Course page further information";s:44:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformation_desc";s:51:"Site level course page further information settings";s:45:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationassign";s:27:"Show assignment information";s:49:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationassigndesc";s:120:"Allow assignment information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of submissions.";s:43:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationquiz";s:21:"Show quiz information";s:47:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationquizdesc";s:114:"Allow quiz information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of submissions.";s:45:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationchoice";s:23:"Show choice information";s:49:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationchoicedesc";s:116:"Allow choice information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of submissions.";s:47:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationfeedback";s:25:"Show feedback information";s:51:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationfeedbackdesc";s:118:"Allow feedback information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of submissions.";s:44:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationforum";s:22:"Show forum information";s:48:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationforumdesc";s:148:"Allow forum information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of contributions when whole forum grading is on.";s:45:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationlesson";s:23:"Show lesson information";s:49:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationlessondesc";s:116:"Allow lesson information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of submissions.";s:43:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationdata";s:25:"Show database information";s:47:"coursesectionactivityfurtherinformationdatadesc";s:114:"Allow data information to be selected to be shown on a course.  For teachers / admins, show number of submissions.";s:34:"cachedef_activitystudentrolescache";s:25:"Caches the student roles.";s:33:"cachedef_activitymodulecountcache";s:78:"Caches the number of students who can access a given module on a given course.";s:30:"cachedef_activitystudentscache";s:49:"Caches the ids of the students on a given course.";s:33:"cachedef_activityusercreatedcache";s:50:"Caches the ids of the new users on a given course.";s:27:"cannotgetactivitycacheslock";s:51:"Cannot get activity caches lock for course id {$a}.";s:9:"setcolour";s:12:"Defina a cor";s:10:"colourrule";s:75:"Please enter a valid RGB colour, six hexadecimal digits or '-' for default.";s:25:"settoggleforegroundcolour";s:42:"Cor do texto do botão "contrair/expandir"";s:30:"settoggleforegroundhovercolour";s:60:"Cor do texto do botão "contrair/expandir" ao passar o mouse";s:25:"settogglebackgroundcolour";s:42:"Cor de fundo do botão "contrair/expandir"";s:30:"settogglebackgroundhovercolour";s:60:"Cor de fundo do botão "contrair/expandir" ao passar o mouse";s:11:"resetcolour";s:13:"Redefinir cor";s:14:"resetallcolour";s:7:"Colours";s:16:"setlayoutcolumns";s:7:"Colunas";s:21:"setlayoutcolumns_help";s:24:"How many columns to use.";s:3:"one";s:2:"Um";s:3:"two";s:4:"Duas";s:5:"three";s:5:"Três";s:4:"four";s:6:"Quatro";s:26:"setlayoutcolumnorientation";s:31:"Defina a orientação de coluna";s:31:"setlayoutcolumnorientation_help";s:108:"Vertical - Seções que vão de cima para baixo.

Horizontal - Seções que vão da esquerda para a direita.";s:13:"columndynamic";s:7:"Dynamic";s:16:"columnhorizontal";s:10:"Horizontal";s:14:"columnvertical";s:8:"Vertical";s:14:"maincoursepage";s:26:"Página principal do curso";s:22:"setlayoutelements_help";s:75:"How much information about the toggles / sections you wish to be displayed.";s:23:"setlayoutstructure_help";s:724:"The layout structure of the course.  You can choose between:<br />'Topics' - where each section is presented as a topic in section number order.<br />'Weeks' - where each section is presented as a week in ascending week order from the start date of the course.<br />'Current week first' - which is the same as weeks but the current week is shown at the top and preceding weeks in descending order are displayed below except in editing mode where the structure is the same as 'Weeks'.<br />'Current topic first' - which is the same as 'Topics' except that the current topic is shown at the top if it has been set.<br />'Day' - where each section is presented as a day in ascending day order from the start date of the course.";s:14:"setlayout_help";s:76:"Contains the settings to do with the layout of the format within the course.";s:16:"resetlayout_help";s:166:"Resets the layout element, structure, columns, toggle all, view single section, icon position, one section and shown section summary to follow the site default value.";s:19:"resetalllayout_help";s:166:"Resets the layout element, structure, columns, toggle all, view single section, icon position, one section and shown section summary to follow the site default value.";s:14:"setcolour_help";s:76:"Contains the settings to do with the colour of the format within the course.";s:30:"settoggleforegroundcolour_help";s:42:"Sets the colour of the text on the toggle.";s:35:"settoggleforegroundhovercolour_help";s:71:"Sets the colour of the text on the toggle when the mouse moves over it.";s:30:"settogglebackgroundcolour_help";s:41:"Sets the background colour of the toggle.";s:35:"settogglebackgroundhovercolour_help";s:70:"Sets the background colour of the toggle when the mouse moves over it.";s:16:"resetcolour_help";s:66:"Resets the colours and opacities to follow the site default value.";s:19:"resetallcolour_help";s:66:"Resets the colours and opacities to follow the site default value.";s:14:"numbersections";s:19:"Número de seções";s:7:"ctreset";s:54:"Opções para reconfiguração de Tópicos Contraídos";s:12:"ctreset_help";s:35:"Reset to Collapsed Topics defaults.";s:18:"settogglealignment";s:31:"Alternar o alinhamento do texto";s:23:"settogglealignment_help";s:45:"Sets the alignment of the text in the toggle.";s:4:"left";s:8:"Esquerda";s:6:"center";s:6:"Centro";s:5:"right";s:7:"Direita";s:20:"resettogglealignment";s:16:"Toggle alignment";s:23:"resetalltogglealignment";s:17:"Toggle alignments";s:25:"resettogglealignment_help";s:61:"Resets the toggle alignment to follow the site default value.";s:28:"resetalltogglealignment_help";s:65:"Resets all the toggle alignment to follow the site default value.";s:21:"settoggleiconposition";s:19:"Posição do ícone";s:26:"settoggleiconposition_help";s:75:"States that the icon should be on the left or the right of the toggle text.";s:25:"defaulttoggleiconposition";s:19:"Posição do ícone";s:30:"defaulttoggleiconposition_desc";s:73:"States if the icon should be on the left or the right of the toggle text.";s:16:"settoggleiconset";s:7:"Ícones";s:21:"settoggleiconset_help";s:32:"Sets the icon set of the toggle.";s:23:"settoggleiconfontclosed";s:23:"Closed toggle icon font";s:28:"settoggleiconfontclosed_help";s:187:"When 'toggleiconset' is set to 'Icon font', this states the default CSS classes to use for the closed icon, i.e. see the FontAwesome icon classes.  If set to '-' then the default is used.";s:21:"settoggleiconfontopen";s:21:"Open toggle icon font";s:26:"settoggleiconfontopen_help";s:185:"When 'toggleiconset' is set to 'Icon font', this states the default CSS classes to use for the open icon, i.e. see the FontAwesome icon classes.  If set to '-' then the default is used.";s:17:"settoggleallhover";s:55:"Ícone 'contrair/expandir todos' muda ao passar o mouse";s:22:"settoggleallhover_help";s:72:"Sets if the toggle all icons will change when the mouse moves over them.";s:5:"arrow";s:4:"Seta";s:4:"bulb";s:8:"Lâmpada";s:5:"cloud";s:5:"Nuvem";s:3:"eye";s:4:"Olho";s:6:"folder";s:6:"Folder";s:12:"groundsignal";s:13:"Ground signal";s:3:"led";s:20:"Light emitting diode";s:5:"point";s:5:"Ponto";s:5:"power";s:6:"Ativar";s:5:"radio";s:5:"Radio";s:6:"smiley";s:6:"Smiley";s:6:"square";s:6:"Square";s:7:"sunmoon";s:10:"Sun / Moon";s:6:"switch";s:6:"Switch";s:3:"tif";s:9:"Icon font";s:18:"resettoggleiconset";s:15:"Toggle icon set";s:21:"resetalltoggleiconset";s:16:"Toggle icon sets";s:23:"resettoggleiconset_help";s:81:"Resets the toggle icon set and toggle all hover to follow the site default value.";s:26:"resetalltoggleiconset_help";s:81:"Resets the toggle icon set and toggle all hover to follow the site default value.";s:10:"onesection";s:11:"Uma seção";s:15:"onesection_help";s:158:"Determina se apenas uma seção deve ser aberta por vez. Nota: Ignorado ao editar a sala para permitir que atividades e recursos sejam movidos pelas seções.";s:17:"defaultonesection";s:11:"Uma seção";s:22:"defaultonesection_desc";s:166:"Determina se apenas uma seção deve ser aberta por vez. Nota: Ignorado durante a editação  para permitir que atividades e recursos sejam movidos entre as seções.";s:25:"defaultonesectioniconfont";s:21:"One section icon font";s:30:"defaultonesectioniconfont_desc";s:188:"State the icon font class to use for the one section link icon, i.e. see the FontAwesome icon classes.  If empty, then default icon 'one_section' in the format's 'pix' folder will be used.";s:17:"defaultheadingsub";s:8:"Defaults";s:21:"defaultheadingsubdesc";s:59:"Default settings that can be overridden at the course level";s:23:"configurationheadingsub";s:13:"Configuration";s:27:"configurationheadingsubdesc";s:33:"Site level configuration settings";s:3:"off";s:3:"Off";s:2:"on";s:2:"On";s:7:"default";s:14:"Default - {$a}";s:20:"defaultlayoutelement";s:32:"Configuração do layout padrão";s:25:"defaultlayoutelement_desc";s:365:"The layout setting can be one of:<br />'Default' with everything displayed.<br />No 'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x'.<br />No section number.<br />No 'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x' and no section number.<br />No 'Toggle' word.<br />No 'Toggle' word and no 'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x'.<br />No 'Toggle' word, no 'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x' and no section number.";s:33:"defaultlayoutelement_descpositive";s:343:"The layout setting can be one of:<br />Toggle word, 'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x' and section number.<br />Toggle word and 'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x'.<br />Toggle word and section number.<br />'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x' and section number.<br />Toggle word.<br />'Topic x' / 'Week x' / 'Day x'.<br />Section number.<br />No additions.";s:22:"defaultlayoutstructure";s:35:"Configuração de estrutura padrão";s:27:"defaultlayoutstructure_desc";s:125:"A definição de estrutura pode ser uma das seguintes:

Tópico

