Dia";s:20:"defaultlayoutcolumns";s:26:"Número padrão de colunas";s:25:"defaultlayoutcolumns_desc";s:37:"Número de colunas entre um e quatro.";s:30:"defaultlayoutcolumnorientation";s:30:"Orientação de coluna padrão";s:35:"defaultlayoutcolumnorientation_desc";s:211:"The default column orientation: Dynamic - Number sections per 'row' adjust to window size, 'Column' setting not currently used.<br>Horizontal - Sections go left to right.<br>Vertical - Sections go top to bottom.";s:17:"defaulttgfgcolour";s:42:"Cor do texto do botão "contrair/expandir"";s:22:"defaulttgfgcolour_desc";s:44:"Toggle foreground colour in hexidecimal RGB.";s:20:"defaulttgfghvrcolour";s:60:"Cor do texto do botão "contrair/expandir" ao passar o mouse";s:25:"defaulttgfghvrcolour_desc";s:50:"Toggle foreground hover colour in hexidecimal RGB.";s:17:"defaulttgbgcolour";s:42:"Cor de fundo do botão "contrair/expandir"";s:22:"defaulttgbgcolour_desc";s:44:"Toggle background colour in hexidecimal RGB.";s:20:"defaulttgbghvrcolour";s:60:"Cor de fundo do botão "contrair/expandir" ao passar o mouse";s:25:"defaulttgbghvrcolour_desc";s:50:"Toggle background hover colour in hexidecimal RGB.";s:22:"defaulttogglealignment";s:31:"Alternar o alinhamento do texto";s:27:"defaulttogglealignment_desc";s:34:"'Esquerda', 'Centro' ou 'Direita'.";s:20:"defaulttoggleiconset";s:15:"Toggle icon set";s:25:"defaulttoggleiconset_desc";s:714:"<table><tbody><tr><td>Arrow</td><td>{$a->arrow}</td></tr><tr><td>Bulb</td><td>{$a->bulb}</td></tr><tr><td>Cloud</td><td>{$a->cloud}</td></tr><tr><td>Eye</td><td>{$a->eye}</td></tr><tr><td>Folder</td><td>{$a->folder}</td></tr><tr><td>Ground Signal</td><td>{$a->groundsignal}</td></tr><tr><td>Light Emitting Diode</td><td>{$a->led}</td></tr><tr><td>Point</td><td>{$a->point}</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>{$a->power}</td></tr><tr><td>Radio</td><td>{$a->radio}</td></tr><tr><td>Smiley</td><td>{$a->smiley}</td></tr><tr><td>Square</td><td>{$a->square}</td></tr><tr><td>Sun / Moon</td><td>{$a->sunmoon}</td></tr><tr><td>Switch</td><td>{$a->switch}</td></tr><tr><td>Icon font</td><td>{$a->tif}</td></tr></tbody></table>";s:27:"defaulttoggleiconfontclosed";s:23:"Closed toggle icon font";s:32:"defaulttoggleiconfontclosed_desc";s:153:"When 'defaulttoggleiconset' is set to 'Icon font', this states the default CSS classes to use for the closed icon, i.e. see the FontAwesome icon classes.";s:25:"defaulttoggleiconfontopen";s:21:"Open toggle icon font";s:30:"defaulttoggleiconfontopen_desc";s:151:"When 'defaulttoggleiconset' is set to 'Icon font', this states the default CSS classes to use for the open icon, i.e. see the FontAwesome icon classes.";s:21:"defaulttoggleallhover";s:55:"Ícone 'contrair/expandir todos' muda ao passar o mouse";s:26:"defaulttoggleallhover_desc";s:16:"'Não' ou 'Sim'.";s:24:"defaulttogglepersistence";s:18:"Toggle persistence";s:29:"defaulttogglepersistence_desc";s:420:"'On' or 'Off'.  Turn off for an AJAX performance increase but user toggle selections will not be remembered on page refresh or revisit.<br />Note: When turning persistence off, please remove any rows containing 'topcoll_toggle_x' in the 'name' field of the 'user_preferences' table in the database.  Where the 'x' in 'topcoll_toggle_x' will be a course id.  This is to save space if you do not intend to turn it back on.";s:21:"defaultuserpreference";s:20:"Initial toggle state";s:26:"defaultuserpreference_desc";s:158:"States what to do with the toggles when the user first accesses the course, the state of additional sections when they are added or toggle persistence is off.";s:26:"settoggleforegroundopacity";s:25:"Toggle foreground opacity";s:31:"settoggleforegroundopacity_help";s:77:"Sets the opacity of the text on the toggle between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:18:"defaulttgfgopacity";s:25:"Toggle foreground opacity";s:23:"defaulttgfgopacity_desc";s:65:"Toggle foreground text opacity between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:31:"settoggleforegroundhoveropacity";s:31:"Toggle foreground hover opacity";s:36:"settoggleforegroundhoveropacity_help";s:86:"Sets the opacity of the text on hover on the toggle between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:21:"defaulttgfghvropacity";s:31:"Toggle foreground hover opacity";s:26:"defaulttgfghvropacity_desc";s:74:"Toggle foreground text on hover opacity between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:26:"settogglebackgroundopacity";s:77:"Opacidade da cor de fundo do botão de contrair/expandir (título do tópico)";s:31:"settogglebackgroundopacity_help";s:102:"Define a opacidade da cor de fundo do botão para contrair/expandir entre 0 e 1 em incrementos de 0.1.";s:18:"defaulttgbgopacity";s:25:"Toggle background opacity";s:23:"defaulttgbgopacity_desc";s:60:"Toggle background opacity between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:31:"settogglebackgroundhoveropacity";s:31:"Toggle background hover opacity";s:36:"settogglebackgroundhoveropacity_help";s:92:"Sets the opacity of the background on hover on the toggle between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:21:"defaulttgbghvropacity";s:31:"Toggle background hover opacity";s:26:"defaulttgbghvropacity_desc";s:69:"Toggle background on hover opacity between 0 and 1 in 0.1 increments.";s:21:"defaulttoggleiconsize";s:16:"Toggle icon size";s:26:"defaulttoggleiconsize_desc";s:119:"Icon size: Small = 16px, Medium = 24px and Large = 32px, or Icon font: Small = 0.8em, Medium = 1.2em and Large = 1.8em.";s:5:"small";s:5:"Small";s:6:"medium";s:6:"Medium";s:5:"large";s:5:"Large";s:27:"defaulttoggleborderradiustl";s:29:"Toggle top left border radius";s:32:"defaulttoggleborderradiustl_desc";s:37:"Border top left radius of the toggle.";s:27:"defaulttoggleborderradiustr";s:30:"Toggle top right border radius";s:32:"defaulttoggleborderradiustr_desc";s:38:"Border top right radius of the toggle.";s:27:"defaulttoggleborderradiusbr";s:33:"Toggle bottom right border radius";s:32:"defaulttoggleborderradiusbr_desc";s:41:"Border bottom right radius of the toggle.";s:27:"defaulttoggleborderradiusbl";s:32:"Toggle bottom left border radius";s:32